WEBVTT

00:06.550 --> 00:08.110
Dezas! Are you okay?!

00:10.640 --> 00:13.110
Yes. Evilbarrow is safe.

00:13.400 --> 00:16.650
And three strong magic forces have 
vanished from the battlefield,

00:16.650 --> 00:18.280
presumably Toma's minions.

00:18.280 --> 00:21.000
Now the tide of the battle 
should turn in our favor.

00:22.430 --> 00:25.680
Good. Seeing how Setsu made it 
in time, we should be able to—

00:25.680 --> 00:27.790
You thought things would change, huh?

00:29.200 --> 00:30.300
Long time no see.

00:32.640 --> 00:35.430
I guess the last time was five years ago,
at the peace ceremony.

00:35.770 --> 00:39.180
No matter which way the tides of battle go,
the end will be the same.

00:39.720 --> 00:41.460
Because I'm here.

00:42.870 --> 00:45.650
Now, it's the beginning of the end.

00:46.060 --> 00:50.750
Do try to resist. I'll teach you what despair is.

02:29.460 --> 02:34.000
<b><i>Episode 12</i></b>

02:29.460 --> 02:34.000
<b><i>Fighting the Last Battle for a Second Time</i></b>

02:35.970 --> 02:38.010
Dezas! Levia!

02:41.670 --> 02:42.760
Setsu...

02:43.230 --> 02:46.070
Hey, Setsu. That was fast.

02:46.660 --> 02:51.800
I knew you'd come, but it still makes 
me jealous to see you actually show up.

02:53.100 --> 02:54.730
Toma, you...

02:54.730 --> 02:59.240
Since I'm going to kill them anyway, 
I thought the least I could do is—

03:02.930 --> 03:05.700
Like hell I'm gonna let you do that.

03:05.700 --> 03:08.450
I knew my Setsu would say that.

03:13.040 --> 03:15.960
I guess there's no point 
in talking to you anymore.

03:16.210 --> 03:19.680
You're right. Once the world 
ends and we're alone,

03:19.680 --> 03:21.270
we'll have plenty of time to talk.

03:40.800 --> 03:43.130
Still quite a brute, aren't you?

03:46.990 --> 03:48.160
Here we go!

03:57.040 --> 03:59.800
The sky... cracked?!

03:59.800 --> 04:02.800
They're on a whole different level.

04:03.740 --> 04:05.930
Are you done warming up?

04:06.660 --> 04:09.930
Yeah. Let's fight for real now.

04:13.140 --> 04:17.230
What is this, strength in numbers?!

04:18.360 --> 04:19.440
Flying Sword!

04:26.030 --> 04:27.050
Damn it!

04:27.620 --> 04:28.780
You're wide open!

04:29.790 --> 04:31.410
Flying Sword, Zetsu!

04:41.940 --> 04:44.680
Oh? Have you lost your touch?

04:47.630 --> 04:50.010
Heh, keep talking!

05:26.530 --> 05:28.540
I like that look on your face.

05:29.850 --> 05:31.440
I let my guard down.

05:31.440 --> 05:34.840
I forgot that you're a tricky fighter.

05:36.000 --> 05:39.310
I know neither of us wants to drag this out.

05:40.060 --> 05:42.290
Let's up the pace.

05:51.600 --> 05:53.490
What is that?

05:53.490 --> 05:55.170
Form Change.

05:56.080 --> 05:58.950
A new possibility for my sacred sword.

06:00.140 --> 06:02.380
Let's go to stage two!

06:13.220 --> 06:14.220
Seriously?

06:16.390 --> 06:20.270
<i>I can't let him start shooting 
that thing everywhere.</i>

06:41.450 --> 06:42.300
Shot!

06:43.210 --> 06:43.900
Damn it!

06:47.760 --> 06:50.350
I guess it's not that easy to land a hit.

06:56.560 --> 06:57.640
Seriously?!

07:11.160 --> 07:13.890
Damn it! Come, Glutton!

07:18.480 --> 07:20.300
Devour it!

07:24.920 --> 07:26.630
Setsu's sacred sword!

07:46.670 --> 07:50.780
That scary sword of yours 
really is a nuisance.

07:51.080 --> 07:54.250
I'm starting to think it looks kinda cool.

07:58.360 --> 07:59.660
Yuki-kun!

08:02.880 --> 08:03.670
Setsu!

08:04.410 --> 08:05.380
Yeah!

08:07.020 --> 08:09.000
Looks like you're all safe.

08:10.810 --> 08:13.220
All of your friends are gone.

08:13.220 --> 08:16.090
Why don't you call it quits now, Toma?

08:21.650 --> 08:23.380
S-Setsu...

08:24.300 --> 08:28.610
You're always... always...

08:36.080 --> 08:42.200
You're always leaving me alone! Only me!

08:47.500 --> 08:48.820
This power...

08:49.900 --> 08:51.710
It's not coming from Toma!

08:56.470 --> 08:58.300
So that's what it is!

09:01.710 --> 09:05.190
Let's settle everything 
once and for all, Setsu!

09:05.630 --> 09:09.770
I'll show you the power I can 
gain by sacrificing my life!

09:09.770 --> 09:11.550
What is that?!

09:11.550 --> 09:14.110
I've never seen magic power like that before!

09:31.200 --> 09:32.830
Limit Break...

09:36.430 --> 09:39.320
Let's end this, Setsu.

09:40.040 --> 09:44.370
Let's stop despair from spreading 
any further across this world.

09:55.570 --> 09:57.490
He's out of control!

09:59.710 --> 10:00.960
What's wrong?!

10:00.960 --> 10:05.460
There's no way <i>my</i> Setsu can do nothing 
but run away like a scared little mouse!

10:12.450 --> 10:15.120
Damn it! I can't get close to him!

10:17.940 --> 10:21.200
How is anyone supposed to fight that?

10:21.200 --> 10:24.100
We can't count on it running 
out of ammo, either.

10:24.100 --> 10:30.560
You're amazing, Setsu! 
But what will you do about this?!

10:32.970 --> 10:33.900
What the...

10:39.840 --> 10:41.350
Too late.

10:45.730 --> 10:50.290
Open your mouth, Glutton!

10:55.130 --> 10:56.170
No!

11:05.560 --> 11:08.380
You useless pieces of trash!

11:09.440 --> 11:11.310
It's all...

11:14.430 --> 11:18.400
Now it's my turn, Toma!

11:26.260 --> 11:27.100
Where is he?!

11:28.170 --> 11:30.870
I'm here!

11:30.870 --> 11:35.670
Flying Sword! Rapid Fire!

11:35.670 --> 11:37.210
What is that move?!

11:43.550 --> 11:47.930
This ends now, Toma!

12:06.290 --> 12:07.290
<i>I...</i>

12:08.540 --> 12:11.040
Setsu. My name is Setsu.

12:09.370 --> 12:12.710
We're the only allies we've got,
since we come from the same place.

12:11.870 --> 12:14.520
You can stop calling me "-san."

12:15.880 --> 12:17.870
<i>I am...</i>

12:19.090 --> 12:20.760
Let's stop this war.

12:19.920 --> 12:21.590
So I'll protect you.

12:20.760 --> 12:24.220
Yeah, let's meet again once we've 
both become heroes for real.

12:24.620 --> 12:25.680
<i>I am...</i>

12:26.890 --> 12:28.300
<i>I am...</i>

12:29.220 --> 12:30.560
Toma the Hero!

12:30.560 --> 12:31.870
Toma-sama!

12:31.870 --> 12:33.600
Of course, Toma-sama.

12:33.600 --> 12:34.140
Toma-sama.

12:34.140 --> 12:35.560
Toma-sama!

12:35.020 --> 12:36.140
That's a promise.

12:36.140 --> 12:37.560
That's a promise, Setsu.

12:37.560 --> 12:39.260
Yeah, it's a promise.

12:39.260 --> 12:41.150
That's a promise, Setsu.

12:48.730 --> 12:50.740
Seriously?

13:13.760 --> 13:15.940
Damn it!

13:32.020 --> 13:34.040
Damn it...

13:40.620 --> 13:41.710
Setsu?

13:48.760 --> 13:49.800
I won?

13:51.000 --> 13:53.660
I beat Setsu?!

13:53.660 --> 13:57.200
The same Setsu who was always 
ahead of me in every way?!

13:57.200 --> 13:59.990
I knew I was right!

13:59.990 --> 14:03.230
This world <i>did</i> need to be destroyed!

14:06.110 --> 14:10.050
You did indeed get a lot stronger.

14:11.060 --> 14:15.580
But until you regain the things 
that were precious to you...

14:16.570 --> 14:18.620
No matter how strong you get,

14:19.440 --> 14:21.420
you'll never beat me.

14:23.890 --> 14:27.910
Dimensional magic?! How do you 
still have the strength to use this?!

14:30.410 --> 14:34.660
If you can do it, I can do it too, obviously.

14:43.820 --> 14:46.110
L-Limit Break?!

14:46.110 --> 14:49.880
Open your mouth even wider!

14:54.200 --> 14:58.120
Earth Eater!

15:07.410 --> 15:08.880
N-No!

15:08.880 --> 15:09.840
I don't want to die!

15:09.840 --> 15:12.760
I don't want to die! I don't want 
to die! I don't want to die!

15:13.190 --> 15:18.640
I don't want to die alone! No!

15:20.000 --> 15:25.530
Hey, Setsu? Didn't you promise 
that you'd protect me?

15:26.040 --> 15:29.840
That's why I tried to stay by your side...

15:30.650 --> 15:33.620
Hey... Setsu... Setsu!

15:33.620 --> 15:37.660
Setsu! Setsu! Setsu!

15:41.870 --> 15:43.100
I see now.

15:43.630 --> 15:46.680
All I really wanted was...

15:47.500 --> 15:50.420
to be by Setsu's side.

16:10.870 --> 16:12.050
Am I...

16:12.050 --> 16:14.220
Hey, you're awake.

16:16.680 --> 16:17.990
Why...

16:18.320 --> 16:22.510
Us killing each other was never my goal.

16:22.510 --> 16:25.630
I wanted to bring you back 
to your senses somehow.

16:25.900 --> 16:30.280
So I took a gamble on letting my sword 
eat only the curse cast on you.

16:30.950 --> 16:35.510
Besides, I promised I'd protect you, right?

16:37.160 --> 16:43.420
But... I did so many unforgivable things...

16:44.200 --> 16:45.180
Why...

16:46.010 --> 16:49.620
So you can atone for what you've done.
No matter how long it takes.

16:49.620 --> 16:52.860
I won't allow you to just die 
and let it all end there.

16:54.400 --> 16:57.080
I knew I couldn't beat you, Setsu.

17:01.540 --> 17:04.260
Setsu! You okay?!

17:07.960 --> 17:08.880
Hey!

17:10.850 --> 17:15.080
Ow, that hurts! Don't touch me!

17:16.690 --> 17:18.810
Cleaning this up is gonna be a lot of work...

17:29.620 --> 17:31.940
They've decided what to do with you.

17:32.180 --> 17:35.570
I see. That was faster than I thought.

17:35.570 --> 17:39.000
Use all of your magic 
power on a transfer spell.

17:39.670 --> 17:44.440
Send my classmates back 
to their original world.

17:44.440 --> 17:45.960
That's your punishment.

17:46.270 --> 17:47.870
What? That's it?

17:49.120 --> 17:52.750
Without your magic power, 
you're just a regular human.

17:52.750 --> 17:54.470
You won't be able to do anything bad.

17:54.470 --> 17:57.640
In that case, we don't care about you.

17:57.640 --> 18:01.400
Given the look on your face, you don't 
intend to do anything wrong, anyway!

18:03.550 --> 18:06.860
So you should just go with them.

18:07.440 --> 18:09.560
I'm sure you can start over, right?

18:10.130 --> 18:11.400
Setsu...

18:11.400 --> 18:15.990
So that's that. I'm counting on you, Toma.

18:16.260 --> 18:19.580
You should thank Setsu for 
negotiating this outcome.

18:19.580 --> 18:22.330
We're only doing this because Setsu asked.

18:27.750 --> 18:32.840
You'll keep every promise, 
even the ones you made with me, Setsu?

18:49.860 --> 18:52.310
Now you can go back to your original world.

18:53.270 --> 18:55.190
All right!

18:59.320 --> 19:01.280
Okay, you guys, take care.

19:01.280 --> 19:03.110
See ya! Goodbye!

19:11.120 --> 19:13.570
You're sure you didn't want 
to go back with them?

19:14.070 --> 19:17.340
My true atonement starts now.

19:17.840 --> 19:19.710
I'm going to go on a trip.

19:20.830 --> 19:26.000
I'll see this world with my own eyes 
and think about what I can do for it.

19:26.000 --> 19:27.180
Just like you did.

19:29.520 --> 19:32.310
Sounds good. I'll be rooting for you.

19:32.800 --> 19:34.590
See you again, Setsu.

19:34.590 --> 19:36.190
Yeah, later.

19:50.080 --> 19:52.540
Right, well, see ya!

19:54.000 --> 19:57.520
I really want to go with you! Please!

19:57.520 --> 20:00.030
No. There's too much post-war 
paperwork to deal with.

20:00.030 --> 20:02.550
Given our positions, we can't get out of it.

20:03.360 --> 20:05.620
I don't wanna be a knight anymore!

20:06.260 --> 20:07.450
I'm here.

20:08.720 --> 20:11.060
Sorry to make you wait.

20:11.440 --> 20:14.650
This is going to be a pretty 
aimless trip. Are you sure?

20:14.650 --> 20:19.730
Yes. I've decided to always stay at your side.

20:20.100 --> 20:22.820
Yeah? Okay, then.

20:23.990 --> 20:25.120
Thanks.

20:25.120 --> 20:25.880
Sure!

20:27.270 --> 20:31.710
Well, time to finally enjoy 
my relaxed other world life.

20:31.710 --> 20:32.650
See ya!

20:35.220 --> 20:36.840
You sure about this, Elka?

20:37.430 --> 20:41.750
I am Setsu-sama's sword. 
And his chair. That's fine.

20:46.800 --> 20:47.900
Hey!

20:48.550 --> 20:49.730
Levia!

20:49.730 --> 20:51.100
Are the seas safe?

20:51.100 --> 20:52.470
Setsu!

20:52.890 --> 20:57.980
Of course the seas are eternally 
at peace, as long as I'm around!

20:57.980 --> 21:00.570
That's great! You're incredible, Levia-san!

21:00.570 --> 21:04.540
Naturally! I've known Setsu for 
much longer than you have, and—

21:05.660 --> 21:09.280
What's the matter with you?!

21:12.580 --> 21:18.380
Ow! Suction! Suction hurts! 
You stupid soft-bodied monster!

21:31.350 --> 21:33.080
Make it so.

21:33.080 --> 21:35.300
Yes, my lord!

21:35.300 --> 21:36.560
Dezas.

21:36.560 --> 21:37.520
Setsu!

21:37.970 --> 21:40.900
Looks like the demonic 
nation is recovering well.

21:40.900 --> 21:44.040
Yes, I'm blessed with great officers.

21:44.570 --> 21:47.000
This damage will be repaired 
before you know it.

21:47.480 --> 21:50.410
Oh, Ruri is doing well in her own shop, too.

21:50.410 --> 21:53.410
Heroic Squid Rings and Fried Octopus!

21:50.410 --> 21:53.410
The end of the line is over here.

21:53.410 --> 21:56.160
One squid ring, please!

21:53.410 --> 21:56.160
Me, too! Hey, don't push!

21:53.770 --> 21:54.600
Wow.

21:54.600 --> 21:56.160
They're so popular!

21:54.600 --> 21:57.240
An invention by the hero who saved the world!

21:57.240 --> 22:01.170
They're crunchy and delicious! Have a bite!

21:57.240 --> 22:01.170
Yay, squid rings! I want one, too!

22:01.440 --> 22:04.980
I had to thank her for 
delivering my precious brooch.

22:04.980 --> 22:07.680
I'm glad I provided her 
with the best location.

22:12.480 --> 22:15.870
I'm telling you, I know Regulus!

22:15.870 --> 22:18.240
Haven't we been through this already?!

22:20.440 --> 22:24.030
Setsu!

22:29.540 --> 22:31.030
Check this out, Setsu!

22:31.310 --> 22:35.370
I'm the commander of the army of 
Zoo Dorado, Roa Leonaire! Cool, huh?

22:35.370 --> 22:38.130
Deputy Commander Shironeko here.

22:38.880 --> 22:40.790
Second Deputy, Mineko.

22:41.220 --> 22:46.170
The three of us are training super hard!
We'll beat you one day, Setsu!

22:46.170 --> 22:47.550
Just you wait!

22:47.990 --> 22:50.800
Seems like the Beastmen nation is okay, too.

22:50.800 --> 22:54.330
I'm glad we have a new 
generation of fine warriors!

23:12.290 --> 23:13.830
Wow...

23:13.830 --> 23:15.300
It's so pretty!

23:15.980 --> 23:20.040
This world's still full of cool things to see.

23:20.040 --> 23:20.960
Yeah!
